# Splice Bots slice 1 from the title to SCENE RESTORED, through the host interface, on the world
# `splice-bots` as the jam build bakes it in (splice-export WORLD_DIR). Walking between beats is stood in
# for by msg 611 (place, centimetres) and 613 (at a weak point). Facts: 0 mode, 1 zone, 2 phase,
# 3 hearts, 4 Heat, 5 robot pieces, 6 cells, 7 rubble gone, 8 boss wall gone, 9 boss down, 11.. a part
# or card held (11 arm, 12 treads, 13 battery, 14 MOVE, 15 DRILL, 16 DRILL+, 17 the core).
size 1280 800
frames 2 20
beat title
expect 0 0
# NEW RUN, then USE THIS CHARACTER on the creation screen: the solar farm by day
key -2
expect 0 7
key -2
expect 0 1
expect 2 1
beat farm
# the farm: Digger picks up the four parts by his sensor as you walk near each
msg 611 -1200 34300
frames 150 20
msg 611 -200 33700
frames 150 20
msg 611 600 33400
frames 150 20
msg 611 4600 35900
frames 150 20
expect 11 1
expect 12 1
expect 14 1
expect 15 1
expect 13 1
# E at the rover: into its room; Tab, the edit bay: the parts and the MOVE and DRILL cards; Tab out
msg 611 1000 34800
frames 5 20
key e
frames 5 20
key -15
expect 0 2
beat bay
key 4
key 5
key 6
key 1
key 2
key -15
frames 5 20
expect 0 1
# E at the desk: Sniper drives you to the garage, and it is dusk when you step out
msg 611 -49730 26000
frames 2 20
key e
frames 5 20
expect 0 9
frames 100 20
beat drive
frames 650 20
expect 0 1
expect 2 2
beat garage
# a click on the rubble: Digger drills it
msg 611 0 -2800
frames 2 20
click 640 400
frames 1500 20
expect 7 1
# a battery cell, then the one blue piece (DRILL+, +25 Heat)
msg 611 -3731 -5304
frames 200 20
expect 6 1
msg 611 -14292 -15544
frames 200 20
expect 16 1
expect 4 25
beat garage-parts
